    "text": "The number of solutions of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is:",
